{
	"name": "Ummi",
	"short_name": "Ummi",
	"description": "Understanding Me Myself & I (Ummi) is a companion app for mental health, wellbeing, and recovery providing quick access to therapy tools learnt in SMART, Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT), Acceptance Commitment Therapy (ACT), Dialectical Behaviour Therapy (DBT) and other therapies.",
